---@field updateMask? string Optional. Field mask is used to specify the fields to be overwritten in the Gateway resource by the update. The fields specified in the update_mask are relative to the resource, not the full request. A field will be overwritten if it is in the mask. If the user does not provide a mask then all fields will be overwritten.

